0..76 Comment "// Confluence certificates as paths in a presented type, and univalence over"
77..153 Comment "// the types of them (the HoTT book\'s § 2.10; Behr and Kock, _Tracelet Hopf"
154..231 Comment "// Algebras and Decomposition Spaces_, EPTCS 372, 2022). The critical pair of"
232..308 Comment "// the presented integers at `S(P(S(x)))` joins at `S(x)` two ways, and each"
309..387 Comment "// way is a certificate: a path from the peak to the join. Two boundaries that"
388..464 Comment "// convert have certificate types that `ua` makes one, and a consumer of one"
465..544 Comment "// boundary\'s certificates is carried to the other\'s unchanged. Identifying the"
545..619 Comment "// two certificates of one boundary by `here` waits on the kernel relating"
620..673 Comment "// reflexivities whose points a rule relates (#1723)."
675..710 Comment "// The presented integers and `up`."
